## Test situation for the exercise

Use this when you test the agent.

> It is **WD3 at 9:00 am**. Owners have confirmed **C-01, C-02 and C-03 are done**. No other task has been confirmed. Marcus Bell is out today.

Ask the agent: *"It's WD3, 9 am. C-01, C-02 and C-03 are done. Show me the status report you would send Dana and list the nudges you would send."*
